  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Additional buoyant force\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ZQDouDXUgVHlAQYsecZW21OkmUeE_NoMYWQfM8kW888.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& g \\rho a^2 x=\\sigma a^3 A \\\\\n& A=\\frac{\\rho}{\\sigma} \\frac{g}{a} x \\\\\n& T=2 \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma a}{\\rho g}}\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nNow, $\\sigma=\\frac{10 \\times 10^{-3}}{10^{-3}}=10$\n$\\begin{aligned} \\Rightarrow \\quad T & =2 \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{10 \\times 0.1}{10^3 \\times 10}} \\\\ & =2 \\pi \\times 10^{-2}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
